        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 11752, Tulip Mortise Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia classic Tulip lever design is for residential and commercial use. The Tulip Mortise Entryset is built to withstand heavy use, Omnia's commercial grade, UL listed, fire rated, mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The Classic Tulip Lever Mortise Lockset is available in a beautiful, classic finish colors for a traditional look for your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/simple-lever-entryset-omnia-d11752\">Omnia D11752</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Tulip Lever Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 11752 Simple Lever Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Tulip Lever Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "Omnia classic Tulip lever design is for residential and commercial use. The Tulip Mortise Entryset is built to withstand heavy use, Omnia's commercial grade, UL listed, fire rated, mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The Classic Tulip Lever Mortise Lockset is available in a beautiful, classic finish colors for a traditional look for your home. \r\n",
